Since your repo currently has only a couple of commits, this is actually a great time to clean it up. The GitHub repo currently shows only **2 commits**. ([GitHub][10])

I'd make:

```text
Commit 1
"Reorganize Content root"

Commit 2
"Reorganize Inventory system"

Commit 3
"Reorganize Player and Interaction systems"

Commit 4
"Reorganize Save system"

Commit 5
"Reorganize C++ source"

Commit 6
